=== A2.1 dictionary (section 6) ===
n -> |4n+1| injective on [-3000,3000]: True ; inverse (chi_4(m) m - 1)/4: True
odd step m* -> 3 m* + 2: True ; even step m* -> (m* + 1)/2: True
product of counts <-> n*k = 4nk+n+k: True
tripling a count <-> n -> -3n-1: True
sign of n = chi_4(m) (n >= 0 iff m = 1 mod 4): True
-3n-1 == -(3n+1) (odd step then negation), for all n: True by algebra
p | N iff n = -1/4 mod p: True ; N = -1 iff n = -1/2 (n>=0): True ; N = -1 iff n = 0 (n<0): True
odd part of N+1 = 2n+1 (n>=0), odd part of n (n<0): True
fixed point of n -> 3n+1 is n = -1/2 on both sides; the class n = 0 (negative side) is not that fixed point

