=== A2.3 lines (section 6) ===
c_-(3n) = odd part of 3n-1 = T_-(n), c_+(3n) = odd part of 3n+1 = T_+(n): identities by definition
odd N in [3,20000]: c_-(3N) = T_+(c_-(N)) for 5000 of 9999; = T_-(c_-(N)) for 1
                    c_+(3N) = T_+(c_+(N)) for 0 of 9999; = T_-(c_+(N)) for 4999
examples (N, c_-(N), c_-(3N), T_+(c_-(N))): [(3, 1, 1, 1), (5, 1, 7, 1), (7, 3, 5, 5), (9, 1, 13, 1), (11, 5, 1, 1), (13, 3, 19, 5), (15, 7, 11, 11), (17, 1, 25, 1), (19, 9, 7, 7), (23, 11, 17, 17)]

=== A2.4 packing polynomial of the F1 joins by brute force (section 5 / THM-5134 (H)) ===
one-apex R(h) = T(W = 2h), h < 64: packing polynomial 1 + psi(h) z and H = 2 psi(h) + 1: True
joins J(h1,h2,s) with W = 2 h1, W' = 2^s (2 h2 + 1) - 1, order <= 13: 1408 checked (max order 13), mismatches: 0
joins with trailing ones on both sides (s = a + b): 192 checked, mismatches: 0

